<section class="case-study__section reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="sonar-next">
  <h2 id="sonar-next">What's next</h2>
  <p>There's more to build. An admin interface, so researchers can run and adapt interviews without touching code. Better synthesis tools, so the output is analysis ready, not just a pile of transcripts. Support for more languages, so people can speak in whichever one they're most comfortable in.</p>
  <p>We're also looking beyond research. Sonar could work for incident reporting, ongoing feedback or supporting a human agent on a live call.</p>
</section>
